<sect1 id="lxqt-panel" xreflabel="lxqt-panel-&lxqt-panel-version;">
  <?dbhtml filename="lxqt-panel.html"?>


  <title>lxqt-panel-&lxqt-panel-version;</title>

  <indexterm zone="lxqt-panel">
    <primary sortas="a-lxqt-panel">lxqt-panel</primary>
  </indexterm>

  <sect2 role="package">
    <title>Introdução ao lxqt-panel</title>

    <para>
      O pacote <application>lxqt-panel</application> contém um painel leve de área
de trabalho do X11.
    </para>

    &lfs130_checked;

    <bridgehead renderas="sect3">Informação do Pacote</bridgehead>
    <itemizedlist spacing="compact">
      <listitem>
        <para>
          Transferência (HTTP): <ulink url="&lxqt-panel-download-http;"/>
        </para>
      </listitem>
      <listitem>
        <para>
          Transferência (FTP): <ulink url="&lxqt-panel-download-ftp;"/>
        </para>
      </listitem>
      <listitem>
        <para>
          Soma de verificação MD5 da transferência: &lxqt-panel-md5sum;
        </para>
      </listitem>
      <listitem>
        <para>
          Tamanho da transferência: &lxqt-panel-size;
        </para>
      </listitem>
      <listitem>
        <para>
          Espaço em disco estimado exigido: &lxqt-panel-buildsize;
        </para>
      </listitem>
      <listitem>
        <para>
          Tempo de construção estimado: &lxqt-panel-time;
        </para>
      </listitem>
    </itemizedlist>

    <bridgehead renderas="sect3">Dependências do lxqt-panel</bridgehead>

    <bridgehead renderas="sect4">Exigidas</bridgehead>
    <para role="required">
      <xref linkend="lxqt-layer-shell-qt"/>, <xref linkend="libdbusmenu-lxqt"/>,
<xref linkend="liblxqt"/>, <xref linkend="lxqt-globalkeys"/>, <xref
linkend="lxqt-menu-data"/>, <xref linkend="lxqt-solid"/> e <xref
linkend="menu-cache"/>
    </para>

    
    

    <!-- I'm not sure lxqt-solid from kf6 is required here any more. 
         I didn't see in in the build log or ldd output. -->
<!-- It's looking for KF6Solid in the plugin-mount plugin's CMakeLists.txt
         file -renodr -->
<bridgehead renderas="sect4">Recomendadas</bridgehead>
    <para role="recommended">
      
      <!--<xref linkend="alsa-lib"/>
 or-->
<!-- (volume plugin; see Command Explanations below
         if not present)-->
<xref linkend="pulseaudio"/>, <xref linkend="libstatgrab"/> (monitor de rede
de intercomunicação e plugins de carga da CPU), <xref linkend="libsysstat"/>
(plugins monitores de CPU e de rede de intercomunicação), <xref
linkend="libxkbcommon"/> (plugin indicador de teclado) e <xref
linkend="lm_sensors"/> (plugin de sensores)
    </para>

  </sect2>

  <sect2 role="installation">
    <title>Instalação do lxqt-panel</title>



    <!-- Fixed in https://github.com/lxqt/lxqt-panel/commit/a49e814a (version 2.0.1)

    <para>

      First, fix a problem identified upstream:
    </para>

<screen><userinput>sed -e '/lxqt_app_translation_loader/a set(CMAKE_EXECUTABLE_ENABLE_EXPORTS TRUE)' \
    -i panel/CMakeLists.txt</userinput></screen>
-->
<para>
      Instale o <application>lxqt-panel</application> executando os seguintes
comandos:
    </para>

<screen><userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;
cd    build &amp;&amp;

cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr \
      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release  \
      ..                           &amp;&amp;
make</userinput></screen>

    <para>
      Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste.
    </para>

    <para>
      Agora, como o(a) usante &root;:
    </para>

<screen role="root"><userinput>make install</userinput></screen>

  </sect2>

